# Per-run raw evaluation output stays operator-only (FR-027). The pattern ignores
# the directory's CONTENTS rather than the directory itself, because git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
results/*
# Only the consolidated baseline — a sanitized, deterministic, digest-addressed
# summary carrying no raw captures — may be committed, and it is named explicitly
# so future per-run artifacts written beside it stay ignored.
!results/consolidated-baseline.json
